From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 06:39:40 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 56/93] soc: apple: rtkit: serve an endpoint's first buffer
 under the ANS hold

The T6050 ANS wake holds the buffers: a request under the hold fails
the wake with -EBUSY and the driver then holds all I/O. ANS on firmware
27.0 asks for none. On 27.2 it asks for its syslog buffer (endpoint 2,
0x4000 bytes) about 2.4 s into the wake, having none yet.

A first buffer for an endpoint replaces nothing the hold protects:
serve it. A request for an endpoint that has a buffer is refused as
before.

With it ANS comes back and the controller is rebuilt after a deep sleep
on a K116s (27.2).

Signed-off-by: Jens Axboe <axboe@kernel.dk>

[re-cut onto the K114s r3d tree]
---
 drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c | 17 ++++++++++++-----
 1 file changed, 12 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c b/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c
index 5080c43e2b6..d480df4cad6 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c
@@ -558,11 +558,9 @@ static void apple_rtkit_management_rx(struct apple_rtkit *rtk, u64 msg)
 	}
 }
 
-static int apple_rtkit_alloc_shmem(struct apple_rtkit *rtk, u8 ep,
-				   struct apple_rtkit_shmem *buffer)
+static int apple_rtkit_alloc_first_shmem(struct apple_rtkit *rtk, u8 ep,
+					 struct apple_rtkit_shmem *buffer)
 {
-	if (READ_ONCE(rtk->ans_hold))
-		return apple_rtkit_ans_fail(rtk, -EBUSY);
 	/* The crash log's buffer is asked for only at a crash: serve it after a strict restart too. */
 	if (READ_ONCE(rtk->strict_retained_buffers) && ep != APPLE_RTKIT_EP_CRASHLOG)
 		return -EPROTO;
@@ -577,6 +575,14 @@ static int apple_rtkit_alloc_shmem(struct apple_rtkit *rtk, u8 ep,
 	return buffer->buffer ? 0 : -ENOMEM;
 }
 
+static int apple_rtkit_alloc_shmem(struct apple_rtkit *rtk, u8 ep,
+				   struct apple_rtkit_shmem *buffer)
+{
+	if (READ_ONCE(rtk->ans_hold))
+		return apple_rtkit_ans_fail(rtk, -EBUSY);
+	return apple_rtkit_alloc_first_shmem(rtk, ep, buffer);
+}
+
 static int apple_rtkit_common_rx_get_buffer(struct apple_rtkit *rtk,
 					    struct apple_rtkit_shmem *buffer,
 					    u8 ep, u64 msg)
@@ -650,7 +656,8 @@ static int apple_rtkit_common_rx_get_buffer(struct apple_rtkit *rtk,
 		goto error;
 	}
 
-	err = apple_rtkit_alloc_shmem(rtk, ep, &request);
+	/* The endpoint has no buffer yet: a first one replaces nothing the ANS hold protects */
+	err = apple_rtkit_alloc_first_shmem(rtk, ep, &request);
 	if (err)
 		goto error;
 	*buffer = request;
